msgstr "ℹ️ River: ваші власні налаштування залишено як є (%1)"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a file path, %2 the reason.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"⚠️ River: couldn't write the starter settings (%1): %2. Without them River "
