#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the uninstall summary.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/window_menu.rs
msgid ""
"%1\n"
"\n"
"Rexon will now close."
msgstr ""
"%1\n"
"\n"
"Програму буде закрито."

